<title>USA: Community First Bankshares Inc Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>Community First Bankshares Inc Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months		Year</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p>Net interest income  35,804  $  31,214 $  134,192 $  109,977  Non interest income   8,238	6,159     27,370     22,488</p>
<p> Net income		6,048	8,624     32,510     29,953</p>
<p>Net income applicable</p>
<p>   to common equity    5,646	8,222     30,900     28,343</p>
<p> Primary EPS		0.33	 0.50	 1.85	 1.82</p>
<p> Fully diluted EPS	0.32	 0.48	 1.79	 1.74</p>
<p>Average Shares:</p>
<p>  Primary	   17,195,727 16,329,391 16,699,021 15,543,129</p>
<p>  Fully diluted   18,664,010 17,808,232 18,154,966 17,276,050</p>
<p>Average assets     3,034,644  2,704,428  2,886,779  2,424,213</p>
<p>Average loans	2,012,654  1,716,249  1,873,073  1,545,497</p>
<p>Average deposits   2,472,676  2,292,303  2,382,776  2,037,002</p>
<p>	  (In thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding Mountain Parks acquisition and one-time charges, Community First said it earned $0.57 a share in the fourth quarter versus $0.51.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
